     "en": "Please speak slowly.",
     "zh": "请说慢一点。"
    },
    {
     "id": "help-4",
     "en": "How do you say this in English?",
     "zh": "这个用英语怎么说?"
    },
    {
     "id": "help-5",
     "en": "What does this word mean?",
     "zh": "这个词是什么意思?"
    },
    {
     "id": "help-6",
