     "who": "B",
     "en": "I am fine, thank you. And you?",
     "zh": "我很好,谢谢。你呢?"
    },
    {
     "id": "greet-d3",
     "who": "A",
     "en": "Good, thanks. Nice to meet you.",
     "zh": "很好,谢谢。很高兴认识你。"
